-- No hardcoded admin password hash is seeded here (a fabricated BCrypt hash
-- would simply fail to match any real password).
--
-- To create the first ADMIN account:
--   1. Register a normal account through POST /api/auth/register
--      (it is created with role = STUDENT).
--   2. Promote it to ADMIN directly in MySQL:
--        UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@quizapp.com';
-- This guarantees the password hash is genuinely generated by BCryptPasswordEncoder.
